# dockerignore for api. Building the api requires wider build context. dockerignore must be in the root of the context for docker to use it 
**/*__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.egg-info
**/*.json
**/*.log
**/.python-version
**/*Makefile
**/*Dockerfile
**/*.dockerignore
**/*docker-compose.yaml
**/*.env*
**/*.github
**/*.mypy_cache
**/*.vscode
**/*.git
**/*.gitignore
**/*.md
**/crawler
**/logs
**/scripts
